{
  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1767656546_8333944_397e66dbf33553b1e6f6aa03232c416a.jpg",
  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:11.2pt;margin-left:0in;\"><strong>About our brand and products</strong></p><p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:9pt;margin-left:0in;min-height:13.8px;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:9pt;margin-left:0in;min-height:13.8px;\">CityWise Deals is a US-based ecommerce brand focused on practical, problem-solving consumer products that improve everyday comfort, convenience, and quality of life. We specialize in trending, high-demand physical products across categories such as pain relief, personal wellness, home, and lifestyle accessories. All products are shipped directly to customers with responsive customer support and clear fulfillment policies.</p><p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:9pt;margin-left:0in;min-height:13.8px;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0in;min-height:13.8px;\"><strong>What makes us different</strong></p><p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:9pt;margin-left:0in;min-height:13.8px;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:9pt;margin-left:0in;min-height:13.8px;\">We focus on conversion-optimized product pages, competitive pricing, and reliable fulfillment to ensure strong EPCs for affiliates. Our offers are structured with simple, fixed CPA payouts, making earnings predictable and scalable. We actively test creatives, improve landing pages, and support affiliates with clear guidelines and fast communication to maximize performance.</p><p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:9pt;margin-left:0in;min-height:13.8px;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0in;min-height:13.8px;\"><strong>How affiliates can earn</strong></p><p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:9pt;margin-left:0in;min-height:13.8px;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:9pt;margin-left:0in;min-height:13.8px;\">Affiliates earn a fixed CPA commission of $45 per completed order, regardless of bundle size or variant purchased. Commissions are tracked automatically through our affiliate platform, with transparent reporting and reliable payouts. Cookie duration is 30 days, and last-click attribution applies.</p><p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:9pt;margin-left:0in;min-height:13.8px;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:11.2pt;margin-left:0in;\"><strong>How to promote us</strong></p><p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:9pt;margin-left:0in;min-height:13.8px;\">Affiliates may promote CityWise Deals using:</p><p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:9pt;margin-left:0in;min-height:13.8px;\"><br></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0in;\" type=\"disc\"><li style=\"margin-bottom:9pt;\">Social media (organic or paid)</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:9pt;\">Content websites and blogs</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:9pt;\">Native advertising</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:9pt;\">Email marketing (opt-in only)</li></ul><p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:9pt;margin-left:0in;min-height:13.8px;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:9pt;margin-left:0in;min-height:13.8px;\">Brand bidding, incentive traffic, misleading claims, or unauthorized coupon use are not allowed. Affiliates should always represent products accurately and comply with applicable advertising policies.</p><p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:9pt;margin-left:0in;min-height:13.8px;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0in;min-height:13.8px;\"><strong>Other information</strong></p><p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:9pt;margin-left:0in;min-height:13.8px;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:9pt;margin-left:0in;\">We welcome both experienced and new affiliates who are committed to ethical, compliant promotion. Our team is actively involved in optimizing offers and supporting partners. Affiliates are encouraged to reach out with questions, creative ideas, or traffic strategy discussions.</p><p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:9pt;margin-left:0in;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:9pt;margin-left:0in;\">https://citywisedeals.com/pages/neck-back-pain-relief-guide</p></div></div>",
